  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Short Walk to Beach | Sleeps 12 | 4 Bikes | Upscale Inlet Beach Retreat on 30A<br><br>Just minutes to the sand. Sleeps 10–12. Includes 4 bikes + resort-style community pool.<br><br>Welcome to your elevated 30A escape in Inlet Beach — a lovely coastal home offering space, style, and walkability in one of the most desirable locations along Scenic Highway 30A. The home features four spacious bedrooms (including two primary suites and one four bed bunkroom)and a refreshing community pool shared by only 8 homes. <br><br>No long beach treks. No parking stress. Just effortless access to everything you came for. <br><br> <br><br>The Experience: This 4-bedroom retreat blends comfort with relaxed coastal style. The spacious bedrooms are designed for privacy and rest, featuring two primary suites, one on the first floor and one on the second floor, along with a four bed bunkroom, both kids and grown-ups will love. You will enjoy light-filled, open-concept living equipped with all the comforts of a beach home. <br><br> <br><br>HIGHLIGHTS <br><br> <br><br>Private, gated community. <br><br>4 spacious bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms: 3 rooms with king beds and a bunkroom with 2 full and 2 twin beds <br><br>Fully equipped kitchen, with stainless steel appliances, complete with wine fridge and a counter height island for extra seating with 4 barstools.<br><br>Additional lounge area on the second floor with comfortable seating, smart TV, and kitchenette with mini-fridge and wet bar – perfect for large groups and kids. <br><br>In-unit laundry with washer and dryer. <br><br>High-speed WiFi throughout. <br><br>Great outdoor space with first and second floor front porches and a covered back porch with gas grill and dining table that seats 8.<br><br>Outdoor shower to rinse off all of the beach fun! <br><br>Neighborhood pool just steps away, shared between just 8 homes. (Yes, your baby monitor will be in-range!) <br><br>Parking on-site. <br><br>4 adult bikes provided. <br><br> <br><br>The layout was intentionally designed for gathering — while still giving everyone room to unwind. <br><br> <br><br>BEDROOMS <br><br>First Floor Primary Suite: king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom with shower and separate soaking tub. <br><br>Second Floor Primary Suite: king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom with multi-jet shower and soaking tub, over-sized walk-in closet (large enough for a pack and play or bassinet) complete with access to theprivate second-floor porch with porch swing and seating.<br><br>Second Floor Guest Suite: king-sized bed, ensuite water closet with private toilet and vanity (shares oversized shower with bunkroom via Jack-and-Jill access). <br><br>Second Floor Bunkroom: two full and two twin bunks, ensuite water closet with private toilet and vanity (shares shower with guest suite via Jack-and-Jill access). <br><br>Flat screen smart TV in each bedroom. <br><br> <br><br>INCLUDED CONVENIENCES<br><br>4 complimentary adult bikes for exploring 30A <br><br>Access to a beautiful resort-style pool complete with bathrooms/changing areas <br><br>5-minute walk to beach access <br><br>First and second floor outdoor space for morning coffee or evening cocktails. <br><br> Bike to Rosemary Beach for brunch. Ride along 30A at sunset. Walk home from the beach in minutes. Prime Inlet Beach Location in a Quiet Gated Community <br><br> <br><br>Perfectly positioned near the best of 30A: steps from beach access, 5 minutes to Rosemary Beach dining + boutiques and activities, 10 minutes to the beautiful Alys Beach amenities, close to scenic trails and coastal hotspots, easy access to top restaurants and shopping. <br><br> <br><br>Enjoy the energy of 30A — from your private gated community avoiding the busiest crowds. <br><br> <br><br>All the comforts of home at no extra charge: linens and towels, basic toiletries, beach towels and chairs, sand toys, boogie boards, games and puzzles for kids and gas grill. <br><br> <br><br>Ideal For: family and multi-family vacations, group getaways, couples traveling together, extended beach stays.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Stay Salty 30a"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
